{"3489140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bartender Twisted Mix", "steam_appid": 3489140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Bartender: Twisted Mix</strong>, where your cocktail-shaking skills are put to the ultimate test! Choose different ingredients to create cocktails. But be careful—if you make a bad drink, something scary might happen! Can you make the perfect mix and keep the bar's secrets hidden?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Drinks:</strong> Mix various ingredients to make unique cocktails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spooky Surprises:</strong> Wrong mixes can lead to unexpected scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Serve drinks in a bar with creepy vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Secrets:</strong> Perfect your mixes to discover hidden recipes and uncover the bar's mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Are You Ready?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every drink you serve matters. Will your cocktails be delightful, or will reveal the bar's dark secrets? Test your skills and courage in <strong>Bartender: Twisted Mix.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Bartender: Twisted Mix</strong>, where your cocktail-shaking skills are put to the ultimate test! Choose different ingredients to create cocktails. But be careful—if you make a bad drink, something scary might happen! Can you make the perfect mix and keep the bar's secrets hidden?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Drinks:</strong> Mix various ingredients to make unique cocktails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spooky Surprises:</strong> Wrong mixes can lead to unexpected scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Serve drinks in a bar with creepy vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Secrets:</s